# Scenario for scripts/record-scenario.py, the end of the build cast,
# after make pcpm8000-sd: CP/M-8000 1.2, built on the board, loaded from
# the SD card with pcpm8001a.dsk and pcpm8001b.dsk beside it as A: and B:,
# booted to A>, and DIR of B:.
#
# Needs the SD card's z8001/pcpm8001.hex and its disks (make pcpm8000-sd).

key R
type L
wait Load?
command z8001/pcpm8001.hex
pace 1.0

# Reset again: the PC comes from the system just loaded.
key R
type G
wait backtrace?
type 5\r
waitfor 30 A>
type DIR B:\r
waitfor 30 A>
pace 1.0

halt
